<!--
    Arabic. Translated from values/strings.xml; the names and the order match it one for one, so
    the two can be diffed side by side when a string changes.

    This is the one right-to-left locale Killit ships, so it is the one to check layout mirroring
    against: ProvideAppLanguage flips LocalLayoutDirection, and ArrowLeft/ChevronRight auto-mirror.

    "Killit", "Shizuku", "adb", "QR" and "Android" are left as they are: they are names, not words.
-->
